// A PCB Studio board derived into a Part Studio. The
// mains-sensor enclosure (`board setup`, cadrs_core::samples::pcb_enclosure): a tube on an end
// plate with a plug whose Live, Earth and Neutral pins stand up into it, "Board location" at
// z 12, and PCB Studio 1's board "AC sensor".
// 01 the enclosure, its tube and end plate see-through (Make transparent).
// 02 the toolbar's Derived: the Derived dialog's source picker lists the Part Studios and the
//    board "AC sensor" (PCB Studio 1 · Main · follows the tab).
// 03 the board picked: its source card, Show 3D model | Layout, Components All with each footprint
//    ticked, Locations, Board point (Outline centre), Board face (Bottom face), skins on. The
//    board comes in at the origin, its outline centred on it.
// 04 Board location picked in the Feature list: the board's outline centre at (0, 0, 12), its
//    bottom face 2 mm below the pins' tips; PS1, the large module on the bottom, runs into the
//    plug and the end plate.
// 05 ✓, closer: "Derived 1" in the Feature list; the Parts list has the board (a folder of its
//    components, closed);
//    the board's skins (mask, gold pads, silkscreen) and the parts' models.
// 06 the chevron opened: AC sensor (board icon), the view row "View 3D | Layout", "Parts (9)".
// 07 Parts opened: J1 … C1 (chip icons, indented) with their eyes; U1, parked off the
//    board, isn't among them.
// 08 Show layout (the feature's menu): the board's layout on its top face (and its bottom
//    layers on its bottom face), the components gone and greyed in the lists, the view row
//    on "Layout".
// 09 Show 3D model again.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("board setup"),
        Wait(10),
        Custom("board transparent Tube, End plate"),
        Wait(2),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("01-enclosure"),
        Click(ui("derived")),
        WaitFor("derived-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-source-picker"),
        Click(ui("derived-board-ac-sensor")),
        WaitFor("derived-board-view"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("03-board-picked"),
        Click(ui("feature-board-location-1")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("04-on-board-location"),
        Click(ui("derived-dialog-accept")),
        Custom("view -40 30 0 0 14 0.07"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(30),
        Screenshot("05-accepted"),
        Click(ui("feature-derived-1-chevron")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-children"),
        ExpectText("feature-derived-1-components", "Parts (9)"),
        Click(ui("feature-derived-1-components-chevron")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-components"),
        RightClick(ui("feature-derived-1")),
        WaitFor("feature-context-menu"),
        Click(ui("feature-board-show-layout")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("08-layout"),
        RightClick(ui("feature-derived-1")),
        WaitFor("feature-context-menu"),
        Click(ui("feature-board-show-3d")),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("09-3d-again"),
    ],
)
